  "releaseNotes": "Version 0.7.0 adds asynchronous simple and typed command handlers, async manager execution methods, cooperative cancellation, optional host-thread callback dispatch, and synchronized history access for overlapping commands. It continues the ContentSystem-backed rebuild introduced in 0.2.0; ContentSystem remains outside the public API. This pre-1.0 release is not a drop-in upgrade from earlier package versions.",
